{"id":"618229","name":"广式腊味煲仔饭","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/618229/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"广式腊肠","amount":"三根"},{"name":"大米","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄心菜","amount":"一棵"},{"name":"油炸豆腐","amount":"一片"},{"name":"红萝卜","amount":"半个"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"两朵"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"广式腊肠备用。","img":"images/618229/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用温水洗净，煮熟。","img":"images/618229/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"自家种的黄心菜。","img":"images/618229/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"掰开，洗净，控干水分，备用。","img":"images/618229/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切好的食材，备用，如图所示。","img":"images/618229/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大米备用。","img":"images/618229/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淘洗干净。","img":"images/618229/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"大米倒入电饭煲中。","img":"images/618229/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加适量的盐和生抽，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/618229/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再放入黄心菜、广式腊肠、红萝卜、香菇和油炸豆腐，按加热键。","img":"images/618229/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"跳到保温键即可。","img":"images/618229/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盛入盘中。","img":"images/618229/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"简单美味！","img":"images/618229/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}